    + Bump org.codehaus.plexus:plexus-i18n from 1.0.0 to 1.2.0
    + Bump org.codehaus.plexus:plexus-archiver from 4.10.3 to 4.14.0
    + Bump net.bytebuddy:byte-buddy from 1.17.8 to 1.18.12
